WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.946
I am a small replica of the Fountain with Fish in Victory Square.

00:00:05.186 --> 00:00:09.087
Outside, water and bronze make passers-by pause.

00:00:09.327 --> 00:00:16.362
Here, in this imaginary museum, my fish come alive to remind you to look a little more slowly.
